div><div class=\"au warn\"><div class=\"au-dot\"></div><div class=\"au-t\"><b>Verdict issued</b></div><div class=\"au-d\"><code>NEEDS_REVIEW</code> \u00c2\u00b7 escalation reason <code>missing_value</code></div></div><div class=\"au todo\"><div class=\"au-dot\"></div><div class=\"au-t\"><b>Awaiting human decision</b></div><div class=\"au-d\">Use the action bar below (<code>A</code> to confirm)</div></div></div><div class=\"audit-foot\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16.5V11M12 7.8h.01\"></path></svg><span>Machine stages are reconstructed from the stored report (the API keeps no timestamps for them). Human decisions are timestamped locally in this browser.</span></div></section></details>\n  </div>", "dock": "<div class=\"act-bar dock\">\n          <button class=\"act primary\" data-kind=\"confirm\" data-tip=\"Confirm verdict\" data-tip-desc=\"Confirm this email\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s comparison verdict\" data-tip-kbd=\"A\" data-tip-pos=\"right\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6L9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg> Confirm<span class=\"k\">A</span></button>\n          <button class=\"act pass\" data-kind=\"pass\" data-tip=\"Pass\" data-tip-desc=\"Mark passed: no mismatch\" data-tip-kbd=\"O\" data-tip-pos=\"right\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M8 12.5l2.6 2.6L16 9.7\"></path></svg> Pass<span class=\"k\">O</span></button>\n          <button class=\"act flag\" data-kind=\"mismatch\" data-tip=\"Mismatch\" data-tip-desc=\"Flag this email as SI\u00e2\u2020\u201dBL mismatch\" data-tip-kbd=\"M\" data-tip-pos=\"right\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"